      "link": null,
      "locked": true,
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "A web crawler is a program that automatically traverses the web by downloading web pages and following links from one\npage to another. It is used to index the web for search engines, collect data for research, or monitor websites\nfor changes.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A web crawler is a program that automatically traverses the web by downloading web pages and following links from one\npage to another. It is used to index the web for search engines, collect data for research, or monitor websites\nfor changes.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 104,
