      "updated": 1788114676514,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "1. Take Seed URL from \"Input List\", request IP from DNs\n2. Fetch HTML from external server (using the IP)\n3. Extract Text from the HTML\n4. Store Text in database\n5. Extract any linked URLs from the web page, add them to URL list (Queue / URL List)\n6. Repeat until all URLs have been crawled",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Take Seed URL from \"Input List\", request IP from DNs\n2. Fetch HTML from external server (using the IP)\n3. Extract Text from the HTML\n4. Store Text in database\n5. Extract any linked URLs from the web page, add them to URL list (Queue / URL List)\n6. Repeat until all URLs have been crawled",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 139,
      "index": "aP",
      "autoResize": true
    },
